# The session store .db is a DERIVED CACHE. The tracked artefact is
# .foreman/session.ndjson, which merges as text; a binary sqlite file in git
# conflicts unmergeably whenever two lanes both record a fact, and it was
# rewritten on every READ until the read path was opened read-only. A cold
# clone rehydrates the .db from the sidecar automatically.
.foreman/session.db

# graphify-out is a DERIVED INDEX, regenerable from repository source. It was
# tracked at 5.1MB and sat 322 commits behind HEAD, while CLAUDE.md told every
# agent to consult it BEFORE opening a file. A generated index that goes stale
# in days is a cache, not a record - the same call already made for the session
# store .db.
graphify-out/
